 </nav>
 <div class="zakat-guide-snapshot">
  <div><span>Common rate</span><strong>2.5%</strong><p>On qualifying net wealth when the relevant conditions apply</p></div>
  <div><span>Gold Nisab reference</span><strong>87.48g</strong><p>Converted using an appropriate gold price you provide</p></div>
  <div><span>Silver Nisab reference</span><strong>612.36g</strong><p>Converted using an appropriate silver price you provide</p></div>
